-          "It might be noted that demographic figures do not contemplate unrecorded flow."
+          "Quiero hablar con el director. → Quería hablar con el director.",
+          "I want to speak to the director. → I was wondering if I could speak to the director."
+        ],
+        [
+          "Abra la ventana. → ¿Podría abrir la ventana?",
+          "Open the window. → Could you open the window?"
         ],
         [
-          "Daría la impresión de que las medidas consulares resultan aún insuficientes.",
-          "It would give the impression that consular measures remain insufficient."
+          "Cierre la puerta. → ¿Le importaría cerrar la puerta?",
+          "Close the door. → Would you mind closing the door?"
