+          "I'll write to you tomorrow."
+        ],
+        [
+          "Que te vaya bien. / Que tenga un buen día.",
+          "Have a good day."
         ]
       ]
     },
+    {
+      "type": "text",
+      "content": "Four things change: the pronoun and verb (*tú* → *usted*), the softening (a plain request → *¿me daría…?*), the greeting and the farewell. You can also switch in the middle of a conversation: from *usted* to *tú* when the other person offers it, and back to *usted* when you enter a formal setting, such as an office or a letter."
+    },
